<title>USA: Alco Standard Corp Q4 Sept 30 earnings.</title>
<headline>Alco Standard Corp Q4 Sept 30 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			 54,945		   47,078</p>
<p> Revs		   1,124,708		  860,124</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 131,953		  117,706</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.48		    $1.62</p>
<p> Net			210,741		  203,672</p>
<p> Revs		   4,099,773		3,091,602</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 127,649		  116,474</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1995 results restated for fiscal 1996 poolings.</p>
<p>Per share after payment of preferred dividends of $4.9 million vs $6.5 million in quarter and $23.3 million vs $15.2 million in year.</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q4 was $0.45 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
